# {{.Name}}

Your own program in the Breadboard lab `{{.Experiment}}`. `bb add app` wrote a minimal Go program here and added it to `experiment.yaml`. Nothing in it is a lesson: it shows what your lab gives this app, and `main` is empty for your code.

Open `main.go` first. Its header comment is a map of the lab, the imports bring in each service's official client library, `init()` checks the variables, and `main` is empty.

